{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the path no one would walk. Believe in what was lost. Some truths are buried where only the high-hearted dare step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cLegendary Tales: Map of Hope\u201d is an adventure game in the Hidden Objects genre, with plenty of mini-games and puzzles, unforgettable characters, and complicated quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucia and her brother have spent years running and hiding from witches, with nowhere left to turn. But their old friend Skarlett brings news that dispels the looming despair: there may be a place where they can finally reunite with their own kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, Skarlett cannot join the journey. The risk of exposing herself among the witches is far too great. Lucia must walk this path alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still, as ever, she and her brother won\u2019t be truly alone. Along the way, they\u2019ll find allies\u2014some familiar, some unexpected\u2014each helping them inch closer to that distant dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will they finally find peace among their kindred?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Prove that the legends are true</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore the magic world and its forgotten secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Gather fascinating collections and find dozens of morphing objects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enjoy stunning locations and beautiful soundtracks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Solve dozens of puzzles and test your skills in exciting mini-games</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Lightning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3801470/3e3a4610b81ab471ddc7fdaedd062c5181b396fd.jpg"},{"name":"Clever","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3801470/a18a9e30967a06f4f75f80dfceb8df5b7beee0e1.jpg"},{"name":"Puzzle Lover","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/a